<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - Bufete started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bufete started as hold.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokerage Credit Lyonnais Securities (USA) Inc. said Monday it was initiating coverage of Mexican infrastructure company Bufete Industrial with a hold recommendation.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe that share price is unlikely to advance, at least in the short term, until a major contract award or a schedule for CFE (Federal Electricity Commission) payments is announced. We rate Bufete shares a hold,&quot; analyst Rafael Diaz wrote in a report.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530))</p>
